like that in your life now?

00:08:07.699 --> 00:08:08.532
Say I.

00:08:08.532 --> 00:08:09.532
- [Crowd] I!

00:08:10.803 --> 00:08:15.666
- You may take it for
granted now, hopefully not,

00:08:15.666 --> 00:08:17.436
